@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

title Circular Linked List (CLL) - Closed Loop Ring Topology

class CircularLinkedList {
  - head: Node
  - _size: int
  + insert_at_position(data, pos)
  + delete_at_position(pos)
  + search(target): int
  + reverse()
}

rectangle "Head Node (Index 0)\n[ data: 10 | next ]" as C0 #LightGreen
rectangle "Node 1\n[ data: 20 | next ]" as C1 #LightGreen
rectangle "Tail Node (Index 2)\n[ data: 30 | next ]" as C2 #LightGreen

C0 -right-> C1 : next
C1 -right-> C2 : next
C2 -down-> C0 : next wraps to Head!

note bottom of C1
  Ring Invariant:
  tail.next == head
  No node points to None
  Cycle termination requires tracking head visit
end note

@enduml
